{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🌍 WUfB - Branch/Country Health Dashboard\n\nThis workbook shows the **security compliance gap** (devices not on the latest security update) grouped by **Branch/Site** and by **Country**, combining a **sorted bar chart** (best for ranking many sites/branches) with a **geographic map** (best for a quick country-level view, since `Country` is a field natively populated by WUfB Reports).\n\n**Bar chart (by Branch/Site):**\n- Useful when you have many sites, including several within the same country; sorted by compliance gap it gives an immediate ranking of the worst sites.\n- Bar color follows a severity threshold (🟢 OK / 🟡 Warning / 🔴 Critical) instead of a continuous gradient, which is easier to interpret at a glance.\n\n**Map (by Country):**\n- Bubble size = device count, bubble color = compliance gap % (green → red heatmap). Good for an at-a-glance geographic overview when devices span multiple countries.\n\n**Source**: `UCClient` (filtered on `OSSecurityUpdateStatus`).\n\n> **Branch** (bar chart only) is derived from the `DeviceName` hostname prefix. Adjust the regex in the query (`extract(@\"^([A-Za-z]{2,4}\\d?)-\", 1, DeviceName)`) to match your own naming convention. If no recognizable prefix is found, the device is grouped as `Unknown (Country)`. The map instead groups directly by the native `Country` field, no hostname parsing needed."
      },
      "name": "text-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "e3a3f001-1111-4a1a-b1c1-111111111111",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 7776000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            },
            "label": "Time Range"
          },
          {
            "id": "e3a3f001-3333-4a1a-b1c1-333333333333",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SeverityFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "datatable(sortOrder:int, value:string, label:string)\n[\n  1, 'Critical', '🔴 Critical (gap >= 30%)',\n  2, 'Warning', '🟡 Warning (gap >= 10%)',\n  3, 'OK', '🟢 OK (gap < 10%)'\n]\n| order by sortOrder asc\n| project value, label",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*"
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all",
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "label": "Severity"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _severity = dynamic([{SeverityFilter}]);\nUCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| extend Branch = extract(@\"^([A-Za-z]{2,4}\\d?)-\", 1, DeviceName)\n| extend Branch = iff(isempty(Branch), strcat(\"Unknown (\", coalesce(Country, \"N/A\"), \")\"), Branch)\n| summarize\n    Devices = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    NotLatestSecurity = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"NotLatest\"),\n    MultipleMissing = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"MultipleSecurityUpdatesMissing\")\n    by Branch, Country\n| extend ComplianceGapPercent = round(100.0 * (NotLatestSecurity + MultipleMissing) / Devices, 1)\n| extend Severity = case(\n    ComplianceGapPercent >= 30, \"Critical\",\n    ComplianceGapPercent >= 10, \"Warning\",\n    \"OK\")\n| where \"*\" in (_severity) or Severity in (_severity)\n| project Branch, Country, Devices, NotLatestSecurity, MultipleMissing, ComplianceGapPercent, Severity\n| sort by ComplianceGapPercent desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Compliance Gap by Branch/Site (sorted worst first)",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "barchart",
        "chartSettings": {
          "xAxis": "Branch",
          "yAxis": [
            "ComplianceGapPercent"
          ],
          "group": "Severity",
          "createOtherGroup": 0,
          "seriesLabelSettings": [
            {
              "seriesName": "Critical",
              "color": "redBright"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "Warning",
              "color": "yellow"
            },
            {
              "seriesName": "OK",
              "color": "green"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "chart-branch-compliance-gap-bar"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 🗺️ Compliance Gap by Country\n\nGeographic heatmap using the `Country` field, which **is natively populated** by WUfB Reports on `UCClient` (unlike `Site`/`Subnet`, which do not exist in the schema). Bubble size = device count, bubble color = compliance gap % (green → red)."
      },
      "name": "text-map-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _severity = dynamic([{SeverityFilter}]);\nUCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| where isnotempty(Country)\n| summarize\n    Devices = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    NotLatestSecurity = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"NotLatest\"),\n    MultipleMissing = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"MultipleSecurityUpdatesMissing\")\n    by Country\n| extend ComplianceGapPercent = round(100.0 * (NotLatestSecurity + MultipleMissing) / Devices, 1)\n| extend Severity = case(\n    ComplianceGapPercent >= 30, \"Critical\",\n    ComplianceGapPercent >= 10, \"Warning\",\n    \"OK\")\n| where \"*\" in (_severity) or Severity in (_severity)\n| project Country, Devices, ComplianceGapPercent, Severity\n| sort by ComplianceGapPercent desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Compliance Gap by Country (map)",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "map",
        "mapSettings": {
          "locInfo": "CountryRegion",
          "locInfoColumn": "Country",
          "sizeSettings": "Devices",
          "sizeAggregation": "Sum",
          "legendMetric": "ComplianceGapPercent",
          "legendAggregation": "Avg",
          "itemColorSettings": {
            "nodeColorField": "ComplianceGapPercent",
            "colorAggregation": "Avg",
            "type": "heatmap",
            "heatmapPalette": "greenRed",
            "heatmapMin": 0,
            "heatmapMax": 100
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "map-country-compliance-gap"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📋 Detail by Branch/Site\n\nSupporting table with a heatmap-colored `ComplianceGapPercent` column, for numeric drill-down behind the chart."
      },
      "name": "text-detail-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _severity = dynamic([{SeverityFilter}]);\nUCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| extend Branch = extract(@\"^([A-Za-z]{2,4}\\d?)-\", 1, DeviceName)\n| extend Branch = iff(isempty(Branch), strcat(\"Unknown (\", coalesce(Country, \"N/A\"), \")\"), Branch)\n| summarize\n    Devices = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    NotLatestSecurity = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"NotLatest\"),\n    MultipleMissing = countif(OSSecurityUpdateStatus == \"MultipleSecurityUpdatesMissing\")\n    by Branch, Country\n| extend ComplianceGapPercent = round(100.0 * (NotLatestSecurity + MultipleMissing) / Devices, 1)\n| extend Severity = case(\n    ComplianceGapPercent >= 30, \"Critical\",\n    ComplianceGapPercent >= 10, \"Warning\",\n    \"OK\")\n| where \"*\" in (_severity) or Severity in (_severity)\n| project Branch, Country, Devices, NotLatestSecurity, MultipleMissing, ComplianceGapPercent, Severity\n| sort by ComplianceGapPercent desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Compliance Gap Detail by Branch/Site",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ComplianceGapPercent",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "palette": "greenRed"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "Devices",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "palette": "blue"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "Severity",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Critical",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OK",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "ComplianceGapPercent",
              "sortOrder": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-branch-compliance-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Notes\n- **Severity bucket**: Critical (gap ≥ 30%), Warning (gap ≥ 10% and < 30%), OK (gap < 10%). Thresholds can be changed directly in the query (`case(...)`).\n- The bar chart groups by `Severity` so color is immediately readable without reading the numbers; the table below provides numeric detail and stays sortable/filterable.\n- The map uses the native `Country` field (populated by WUfB Reports on `UCClient`) with `locInfo: CountryRegion`; no hostname parsing or external lookup is required. See also `kql/15-country-compliance-heatmap.kql` for the standalone version of this query."
      },
      "name": "text-footer"
    }
  ],
  "fallbackResourceIds": [],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json",
  "styleSettings": {},
  "fromTemplateId": "custom-wufb-branch-health-dashboard"
}
